File: python/libxml.c
Line: 1666
Function: libxml_xmlParserCtxtGetErrorHandler
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: PyparserCtxt_Get(pyobj_ctxt) is not validated. If it returns NULL, the subsequent access to ctxt->_private dereferences a NULL pointer.

